      "text": "This work is an open-source Python package that implements a pipeline of processing, analyzing, and visualizing an argument corpus and the attacking relationship inside the corpus. It also implements the corresponding GUIs on a scientific workflow platform named [Orange3] https://orangedatamining.com/, so that users with little knowledge of Python programming can also benefit from it.",
